{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:13 2026-06-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:24 2026-06-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:24 2026-06-02 HKT</p><p>黃大仙東頭村道東頭村道美東邨對出，今（2日）早上約9時，一部的士沿東頭村道行駛，其間因駕駛態度問題，引起警方巡邏車注意，警員遂截停該部的士調查，發現年約70多歲的士司機神情呆滯，支吾以對，於是向司機進行快速口腔液測試，驗出對海洛英及可卡因毒品呈陽性反應，涉毒後駕駛被捕。車廂內暫未找到毒品，警員稍後召來搜索犬到場搜車。</p><img alt=\"涉案的士司機。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6fafa37188c56358885b01d4018b0523/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_14_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"搜索犬到場搜車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1a3172cdda32b7c0ccff856464a51a0f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_15_57.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b673e52d072904aeb29c5d560207d89c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_14_05_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/66dfa0c878e476a107bbca891fbf9a31/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_14_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75e67f681ddd842e69dc773aea9e50f2/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_01_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉案的士。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/79bcedc9f3361f666d6395ba05b23635/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_01_48.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e14028b9b3f9ef2a818334be3e1f6c9f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_01_47.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/61249fb74ffaa6daa14bc25de20552dc/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_01_46.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉案的士司機。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/939f58d04dbe84239406faa471527081/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_01_45.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/447298f99721694f4c13e30334805e1c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-02_at_11_01_45_1__0.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T04:54:44.794974+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}